ation:</strong> Submit required system details and verification documents</li><li><strong>Verification:</strong> Our team validates your solar system data</li><li><strong>Registration:</strong> Your carbon credits are officially registered</li><li><strong>Revenue:</strong> Start earning from your carbon credits!</li></ol></div><p style=\"margin: 0 0 30px; color: #1A1A1A; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.6;\">To get started, please access your onboarding portal where we''ll walk you through everything step-by-step:</p><div style=\"text-align: center; margin: 30px 0;\"><a href=\"{{onboarding_link}}\" style=\"display: inline-block; padding: 22px 50px; background: linear-gradient(135deg, #F4C430 0%, #E6B800 100%); color: #1A1A1A; text-decoration: none; border-radius: 8px; font-weight: 700; font-size: 18px; box-shadow: 0 6px 20px rgba(244, 196, 48, 0.5); border: 2px solid #FFFFFF; transition: all 0.3s ease;\">Start Onboarding →</a></div><p style=\"margin: 30px 0 0; color: #4A5568; font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.6;\">If you have any questions during the process, our support team is here to help at <a href=\"mailto:support@crunchcarbon.com\" style=\"color: #F4C430; text-decoration: none;\">support@crunchcarbon.com</a></p><p style=\"margin: 15px 0 0; color: #4A5568; font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.6;\">Excited to have you on board!<br>The Crunch Carbon Team</p></td></tr></table><table role=\"presentation\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" border=\"0\" width=\"100%\" style=\"max-width: 600px; margin: 0 auto; background-color: #1A1A1A; border-radius: 0 0 12px 12px;\"><tr><td style=\"padding: 30px; text-align: center;\"><p style=\"margin: 0 0 10px; color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 14px; font-weight: 600;\">Crunch Carbon</p><p style=\"margin: 0; color: #A0AEC0; font-size: 12px;\">Questions? Contact <a href=\"mailto:support@crunchcarbon.com\" style=\"color: #F4C430; text-decoration: none;\">support@crunchcarbon.com</a></p></td></tr></table></td></tr></table></body></html>"
